&lt;p&gt;We are seeking Mechanical Engineer Interns for &lt;strong&gt;Summer 2027&lt;/strong&gt;! This is a paid, in-person, 12 week internship. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
